  "notes": "In the DeepSeek API, both deepseek-chat (non-thinking) and deepseek-reasoner (thinking) moved to DeepSeek-V3.1 on 2025-08-21, so it also replaced DeepSeek-R1-0528 behind deepseek-reasoner; that lifecycle link belongs on the R1-0528 record. The API names are not used as aliases because they served many models over time. Input modalities are not stated in the V3.1 sources, so they are left out. The Hugging Face repository for the base model existed from 2025-08-19, but no DeepSeek page states that date."
